<title>USA: Fannie Mae to redeem $560 mln in debentures.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae to redeem $560 mln in debentures.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal National Mortgage Association said Friday that on March 9 it will redeem all $560 million of its 7.89 percent outstanding debenture series SM-2002-C due March 9, 2002. Cusip number is 3135863J6.</p>
<p>Fannie Mae said the redemption price of the debentures will be equal to 100 percent of the principal amount redeemed, plus accrued interest thereon to the redemption date.</p>
</text>
